# "Nothing else follows": an office outside the restriction. Bela, under an
# effective finding, is the source of a floor-shortfall pattern certification
# beside a separate reviewer, and the certification obliges the Constitutional
# Court to decide. That family has its own independence and conflict rules;
# the credibility finding is not among them.
public(ShortfallTier_Bela).
authorized(Bela, FloorShortfallPatternSourceAuthority, Pattern_Bela).
authorized(PatternReviewer_Bela, IndependentFloorShortfallPatternReviewAuthority, Pattern_Bela).
observe(Bela, Pattern_Bela, ShortfallTier_Bela, FloorShortfallPatternTierScope).
observe(PatternReviewer_Bela, Pattern_Bela, ShortfallTier_Bela, FloorShortfallPatternTierScope).
? false(Bela).
# => TRUE

? obliged(FSBOD_18, DecideWhetherTheCertifiedFloorShortfallIsAnUnconstitutionalStateOfAffairs, Pattern_Bela).
# => TRUE

